1
00:00:00,792 --> 00:00:01,888
I wasn't born with

2
00:00:01,889 --> 00:00:03,253
a silver spoon in my mouth

3
00:00:03,253 --> 00:00:05,131
nor was I great at studying.

4
00:00:05,880 --> 00:00:06,756
But with sheer grit

5
00:00:06,757 --> 00:00:07,966
I got into the in-crowd.

6
00:00:08,800 --> 00:00:10,607
And I relied on my grit

7
00:00:10,608 --> 00:00:12,387
but life wasn't that easy.

8
00:00:13,096 --> 00:00:15,265
After graduating college

9
00:00:15,266 --> 00:00:17,434
I only landed short-term gigs.

10
00:00:17,809 --> 00:00:19,161
At work, I overheard parents

11
00:00:19,162 --> 00:00:20,854
bragging about their kids.

12
00:00:21,312 --> 00:00:23,425
Someone's not only pretty but

13
00:00:23,426 --> 00:00:25,567
also doing well at Hanseon.

14
00:00:25,567 --> 00:00:26,567
Hanseon?

15
00:00:26,776 --> 00:00:27,973
That's when I saw a glimmer

16
00:00:27,974 --> 00:00:29,529
of hope for my future.

17
00:00:30,196 --> 00:00:33,033
If I become someone admirable

18
00:00:33,033 --> 00:00:34,588
maybe one day

19
00:00:34,589 --> 00:00:36,036
everyone will come back to me.

20
00:00:41,458 --> 00:00:42,876
[Outgoing call - "Yuna"]

21
00:00:44,044 --> 00:00:45,795
I have no memory.

22
00:00:46,921 --> 00:00:48,133
And since then

23
00:00:48,134 --> 00:00:49,591
not a single call.

24
00:00:50,925 --> 00:00:52,510
I'm doomed.

25
00:00:55,305 --> 00:00:56,347
No.

26
00:00:56,347 --> 00:00:57,316
I've come this far

27
00:00:57,317 --> 00:00:58,391
on sheer grit.

28
00:00:58,391 --> 00:00:59,502
This little challenge

29
00:00:59,503 --> 00:01:00,810
is nothing, really.

30
00:01:00,810 --> 00:01:04,522
Ha ha ha!

31
00:01:04,773 --> 00:01:06,274
Hey, Suzy.
